{
  "_comment": [
    "crew — Dock controls, personal-projects edition.",
    "Installed by `crew apply` to <repo>/.cmux/dock.json and added to",
    ".git/info/exclude so it stays untracked.",
    "",
    "Trimmed for a laptop of hobby repos: no CI beyond GitHub checks, no",
    "shared database. `spec` runs crew-spec, which detects the repo's test",
    "runner (npm/pytest/cargo/go) instead of assuming one stack.",
    "",
    "The web Dock (beta) seeds the board and the usage dashboard as chromeless",
    "browser controls. The board page is inert until crew-listen pushes the",
    "renderer into it; crew-board adopts the seeded surface instead of creating",
    "its own. __INTENT_PORT__ is substituted by `crew apply` and must match the",
    "intent server's pin (CREW_INTENT_PORT, default 7345)."
  ],
  "controls": [
    {
      "id": "board",
      "title": "Crew",
      "type": "browser",
      "chrome": false,
      "url": "file://__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/board/board.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "usage",
      "title": "Usage",
      "type": "browser",
      "chrome": false,
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:__INTENT_PORT__/usage",
      "height": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "checks",
      "title": "Checks",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-watch 30 gh pr checks",
      "cwd": ".",
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "diffs",
      "title": "Diffs",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-diff",
      "cwd": ".",
      "height": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "sessions",
      "title": "Sessions",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-resume",
      "cwd": ".",
      "height": 360
    },
    {
      "id": "git",
      "title": "Git",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-watch 3 git status -sb",
      "cwd": ".",
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "spec",
      "title": "Spec",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-spec --help",
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "sandbox",
      "title": "Sandbox",
      "command": "__HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-watch 10 __HOME__/.config/cmux/crew/bin/crew-sandbox status",
      "cwd": ".",
      "height": 220
    }
  ]
}
